X: 1
T: Malena
C: Lucio Demare (music), Homero Manzi (lyrics), 1942
O: Argentina
R: Tango
N: A tango about a tango singer, "Malena canta el tango como ninguna";
N: Manzi's lyric is counted among the finest of the 1940s golden age.
N: Melody and chords from John Chambers' transcription (trillian.mit.edu,
N: tango/Malena_Cm), the only source found; the notes render back to it
N: exactly (the last A bar drops one chord on a rest). Transposed up a tone from C minor / C major to D minor / D major
N: (range D4 to F#5). Played A-B; the source's form is A-B-A-B-A.
N: The accompaniment uses a tango 3-3-2 pattern (%%MIDI gchord).
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=120
